# Run monitoring and failure guidance

After triggering a GitHub Actions run for deploy or CI, always monitor the run to completion and report back whether it passed or failed.

If the run fails, include exactly one next terminal command the user should run to inspect the failure details (for example, a `gh run view ... --log-failed` command for that run).
